  <data name="LabelRSASupport.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>These features are only supported by Sigma pads with the firmware 1.16 or newer and Omega pads with the firmware 1.25 or newer! 
The Compute Hash of Display Content before Capturing feature is only supported by Alpha pads with the firmware 1.8 or newer!</value>
  </data>
